Pozdravljeni, Rkoholiki!

Ekipa PRstatistics s Škotske vabi na tečaje statistike, usmerjene v celo
paleto različnih področij biologije.
Lanskega novembra sem se udeležila odličnega tečaja "Spatial analysis of
ecological data using R", zato z veseljem delim informacijo o
prihajajočih tečajih dalje.
Če koga kaj od tega zanima, kontakt organizatorja najdete spodaj.

LP, Urša

------------------

Hi Ursa,

I hope you are well and you were able to put to use some of the things
you learnt during the course at SCENE.

We have a lot more courses planned this year and I am trying to get them
circulated around as many organisations as possible, I was hoping to ask
a favor, would you mind circulating this email (which lists our next 10
courses) if possible?

Thanks in advance,

Oliver

1) Advancing in statistical modelling using R (ADVR)
Date: 2 May 2016 - 6 May 2016
Instructors: Dr. Luc Bussière, Dr. Tom Houslay
http://prstatistics.com/course/advancing-in-statistical-modelling-using-r-advr/

2) Time Series Models for Ecologists and Climatologists (TSME)
Date: 10 May 2016 - 13 May 2016
Instructors: Dr. Andrew Parnell, Dr. Doug McNeall,
http://prstatistics.com/course/time-series-models-for-ecologists-and-climatologist/

3) Introduction to Python for Biologists (IPYB)
Date: 23 May 2016 - 27 May 2016
Instructors: Dr. Martin Jones
http://prstatistics.com/course/introduction-to-python-for-biologists-ipyb/

4) Advances in Spatial Analysis of Multivariate Ecological Data: Theory
and Practice (MVSP)
Date: 11 July 2016 - 15 July 2016
Instructors: Prof. Pierre Legendre, Dr. Olivier Gauthier,
http://prstatistics.com/course/advances-in-spatial-analysis-of-multivariate-ecological-data-theory-and-practice/

5) Advances in DNA taxonomy (DNTX)
Date: 8 August 2016 - 11 August 2016
Instructors: Dr. Diego Fontaneto, Prof. Ziheng Yang
http://prstatistics.com/course/advances-in-dna-taxonomy-dntx/

6) Introduction to LINUX workflow for Biologists (ILWB)
Date: 15 August 2016 - 19 August 2016
Instructor: Dr. Martin Jones
http://prstatistics.com/course/introduction-to-linux-workflows-for-biologists-ilwb/

7) Exploratory methods for genetic data analysis (GDAR)
Date: 15 August 2016 - 20 August 2016
Instructor: Dr. Thibaut Jombart
http://prstatistics.com/course/genetic-data-analysis-using-r-gdar/

8) Introduction to Bayesian hierarchical modelling using R (IBHM)
Date: 23 August 2016 - 26 August 2016
Instructors: Dr. Andrew Parnell
http://prstatistics.com/course/introduction-to-bayesian-hierarchical-modelling-using-r-ibhm/

9) Model-base multivariate analysis of abundance data (MBMV)
Date: 3 October 2016 - 7 October 2016
Instructors: Prof. David Warton
http://prstatistics.com/course/model-based-multivariate-analysis-of-abundance-data-using-r-mbmv/

10) Applied Bayesian modelling for Ecologists and Epidemiologists (ABME)
Date: 24 October 2016 - 29 October 2016
Instructors: Dr. Matt Denwood, Prof. Jason Matthiopoulos
http://prstatistics.com/course/applied-bayesian-modelling-for-ecologists-and-epidemiologists-abme/

